Hospital Management System

About the Project

The Hospital Management System is a web-based project designed to organize basic hospital information and simplify hospital management tasks.

Features

- User Login
- User Registration
- Doctor List
- Patient List
- Laboratory Tests
- Pharmacy Information

Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

Project Objective

To provide a simple interface for managing hospital-related information.

How to Run

1. Download or clone this repository.
2. Open the project folder.
3. Open "index.html" in a web browser.

